<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1031] Query metrics updated incorrectly</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1031</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If I execute valid sql fields query - metrics updated correctly (at least on partitioned cache).&lt;br/&gt;
But if I execute invalid SQL (select * from NOT_EXISTING_TABLE) metrics updated not as I expected: updated executed queries counter, but NOT updated failed queries counter.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please fix and add tests for ALL caches modes (PART, REPL, LOCAL) x (TRANSACTIONAL, ATOMIC).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
